></section></div></div></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-[11px] text-smoke-500">Calldata: 388 bytes</p></section></div><details class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-smoke-200 bg-white"><summary class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-smoke-700 hover:bg-grey-25">Raw transaction payload</summary><div class="border-t border-smoke-200 p-4"><p class="mb-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-smoke-600">Exact app-controlled JSON-RPC call fields. Hex value is the native token amount; data is the complete calldata.</p><pre class="max-h-[28rem] overflow-auto rounded-xl border border-smoke-200 bg-grey-900 p-4 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-grey-25">{
