] text-smoke-500">chain 8453</span></div><dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm"><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Destination | SafeProxyFactory</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs text-ink">0x4e1DCf7AD4e460CfD30791CCC4F9c8a4f820ec67</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Native value</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-ink">0 ETH | 0 wei</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Safe gas</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-ink">0</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-5 border-t border-smoke-200 pt-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Contract function</p><p class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-sm font-medium text-ink">createProxyWithNonce(address, bytes, uint256)</p><div class="mt-3 space-y-2"><div class="rounded-lg bg-grey-25 px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-700">singleton <span class="font-mono font-normal text-smoke-500">address</span></p><p class="break-all font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink">0x41675C099F32341bf84BFc5382aF534df5C7461a</p></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-grey-25 px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-700">initializer <span class="font-mono font-normal text-smoke-500">bytes, decoded</span></p><div class="mt-3 space-y-3 text-xs"><dl class="space-y-0.5"><p class="font-medium text-ink">1. Safe setup</p><div class="flex items-start gap-1"><dt class="shrink-0 text-smoke-500">Owners:</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-all font-mono text-smoke-700">0x1111111111111111111111111111111111111111, 0x2222222222222222222222222222222222222222</dd></div><div class="flex items-start gap-1"><dt class="shrink-0 text-smoke-500">Threshold:</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-all font-mono text-smoke-700">2 of 2</dd></div><div class="flex items-start gap-1"><dt class="shrink-0 text-smoke-500">Fallback handler:</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-all font-mono text-smoke-700">0xfd0732Dc9E303f09fCEf3a7388Ad10A83459Ec99</dd></div><div class="flex items-start gap-1"><dt class="shrink-0 text-smoke-500">Setup hook:</dt><dd class="min-w-0 break-all font-mono text-smoke-700">none</dd></div></dl><p class="text-smoke-500">The exact bytes are in the raw payload below.</p></div></div><div class="rounded-lg bg-grey-25 px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-700">saltNonce <span class="font-mono font-normal text-smoke-500">uint256</span></p><p class="break-all font-mono text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink">7</p></div></div></div><p class="mt-3 text-[11px] text-smoke-500">Calldata: 548 bytes</p></section></div><details class="mt-4 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-smoke-200 bg-white"><summary class="cursor-pointer px-4 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-smoke-700 hover:bg-grey-25">Raw transaction payload</summary><div class="border-t border-smoke-200 p-4"><p class="mb-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-smoke-600">The exact message your signature commits to, plus the resulting app-controlled call. Hex value is the native token amount; data is the complete calldata.</p><pre class="max-h-[28rem] overflow-auto rounded-xl border border-smoke-200 bg-grey-900 p-4 font-mono text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-grey-25">{
