}</pre></div></details></div><footer class="shrink-0 border-t border-smoke-200 bg-white px-4 py-4 sm:px-6"><label class="flex cursor-pointer items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border border-smoke-200 bg-grey-25 p-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink"><input class="mt-0.5 h-4 w-4 shrink-0" type="checkbox"><span>I reviewed the chain, destination, native value, and calldata, plus the exact message your signature commits to. I agree to authorize this exact call.</span></label><div class="mt-4 flex flex-col-reverse gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:justify-end"><button type="button" class="btn-secondary min-h-[44px] px-5 text-sm">Cancel</button><button type="button" disabled="" class="btn-primary min-h-[44px] px-5 text-sm">Agree &amp; authorize</button></div></footer></div></dialog>"
