><img alt="" aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" class="inline-block rounded-full " src="asset">Ethereum</span><span class="font-mono text-[11px] text-smoke-500">chain 1</span></div><dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm"><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Destination</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs text-ink">0x5555555555555555555555555555555555555555</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Native value</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-ink">0 ETH | 0 wei</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Safe gas</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-ink">50,000</dd><dd class="mt-1 text-xs text-split-800">If this call fails, the Safe still executes and uses this nonce.</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-5 border-t border-smoke-200 pt-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Calls it makes, in order</p><div class="mt-2 space-y-3"><section class="rounded-xl border border-smoke-200 bg-white p-4 sm:p-5"><p class="mb-2 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-smoke-500">Call 1 of 2</p><dl class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm"><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">From</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs text-ink">0x5555555555555555555555555555555555555555</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Destination</dt><dd class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-xs text-ink">0x3333333333333333333333333333333333333333</dd></div><div><dt class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Native value</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-ink">0 ETH | 0 wei</dd></div></dl><div class="mt-5 border-t border-smoke-200 pt-4"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-600">Contract function</p><p class="mt-1 break-all font-mono text-sm font-medium text-ink">approve(address, uint256)</p><div class="mt-3 space-y-2"><div class="rounded-lg bg-grey-25 px-3 py-2.5"><p class="text-xs font-medium text-smoke-700">spender <span class="font-mono font-normal text-smoke-500">ad